    "detailed_description": "Jump into the scrum and reclaim what is rightfully yours!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525440/extras/260e8e74196426c3aa600cc5835357f3.poster.avif?t=1694617854\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525440/extras/260e8e74196426c3aa600cc5835357f3.webm?t=1694617854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525440/extras/260e8e74196426c3aa600cc5835357f3.mp4?t=1694617854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Fight off ever-increasing hordes of enemies as you progress from level to level<br><br></li><li> Lead troops into battle with a variety of different weapons and equipment<br><br></li><li> Auto-shooting projectiles and satisfying melee combat<br><br></li><li> Earn new equipment and unlock new upgrades and go further than ever before<br><br></li><li> Cute, colorful hand-drawn art<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525440/extras/d8add259ff84cc3ff0c9cf117f91e0f9.poster.avif?t=1694617854\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525440/extras/d8add259ff84cc3ff0c9cf117f91e0f9.webm?t=1694617854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525440/extras/d8add259ff84cc3ff0c9cf117f91e0f9.mp4?t=1694617854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li> Made with love</li></ul>",
